    "body": "## Problem\n\nA server can send `lsp.Color` components outside [0, 1] (e.g. for an out-of-gamut color). `get_hex_code()` then builds a hex code with a negative or 3-digit component, `get_contrast_color()` errors with \"Invalid color format\", and no colors from that response are shown.\n\n## Solution\n\nClamp each component to [0, 1] before converting it to [0, 255].\n\nFixes #42552\n\nTests: added \"clamps color components outside the [0, 1] range\" to `test/functional/plugin/lsp/document_color_spec.lua` (red = -0.2, green = 1.3, blue = 0.5 → `#00ff80`). It fails on master and passes with the fix; all 9 tests in the file pass. stylua check is clean.\n\nAI-assisted; I reviewed the change and ran the tests above.\n",
